<div class="principles reveal">
        <div><h3>Honest</h3><p>A guess never looks like a fact. When we're not sure, the app says so.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Private</h3><p>Your data stays on your device and in your own iCloud. We don't keep a copy.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Native</h3><p>Built in SwiftUI for Apple platforms, with Liquid Glass, widgets and Live Activities.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Measured</h3><p>Analytics is our specialism, so every number on screen has to earn its place.</p></div>
